=2 Walkthrough
Your role in this mission is to find and capture the Qiqirn who is the spy. He looks and talks like every other qiqirn, but using information given to you by other Qiqirn, you can deduce which one he is.
* There are many {n:Qiqirn Spy} (NPC) spread over the whole map, and many Puks too. The Puk are agressive, so it is advised you are able to sleep, charm, or have another method of distracting them.
* Talking to the {n:Qiqirn Spy} gives 3 options

:* Capture
:* Talk
:* Nothing

* The Qiqirn always tell the truth, except for the spy. If they point you in the direction of the spy, listen to their advice.
* The directions Qiqirn can give you are :

:* Should be close
:* Should be far
:* <X> amount of Yalms away
:* Some Qiqirns can be completely oblivious to where the spy is and not know anything at all

* The easiest way to tell which one is the liar, is to talk to multiple NPCs in an area. If all of them are consistent except one, the one will most likely be the spy. For example, if all the Qiqirn say "Should be near", and "It is to the east", when only one says "To the west", it most likely will be the spy.
* When the spy is found, he will say "... how you know that?"
* If you try to capture any Qiqirn other then the spy, you will no longer be able to get information from that Qiqirn and you will lose some Assault Points.
* The Puk deaggro very quickly, and respawn quick too.

\**Note**: If you are just looking to complete this mission quickly then select capture on every Qiqirn Spy until you win.
The {p:Rune of Release} appears within the southwest portion of (I-8). AP Reward is 1200 base, minus 66 AP per false accusation made.
